  "description": "Official NVIDIA API Catalog / NIM OpenAI-compat inference (INPUT llm_input → OUTPUT llm_output). operation selects chat (POST /v1/chat/completions) or embeddings (POST /v1/embeddings) at https://integrate.api.nvidia.com. Auth is StudioQuack secret api_key (typically nvapi-…) sent as Authorization Bearer. File/image payloads use type file (platform ref-id). Docs: https://docs.nvidia.com/nim/large-language-models/latest/reference/api-reference.html. Terms: https://ngc.nvidia.com/legal/terms. Never log api_key.",
