      "label": "Stream",
      "type": "select",
      "description": "Purpose: controls whether NVIDIA NIM requests a streamed completion and fans live deltas through helper emitPartial. Canonical flag. When true the node POSTs stream:true, parses SSE data: lines, emitPartial(\"thinking\", delta) for reasoning/thinking and emitPartial(\"answer\", delta) for content; thoughts also appear on llm_output.result.thoughts / thinking; finish_reason, usage and tool_calls are assembled at the end. Accepted: select true | false. Default: true. Invalid/blank → true. Example: true.",
